                ("BIO101", "Cell Division", "Which stage of the cell cycle involves cell growth and preparation for DNA replication?", "G1 phase", "S phase", "G2 phase", "M phase", "A", "Explanation: G1 phase is the period of cell growth before DNA synthesis."),
                ("BIO101", "Cell Division", "Which of the following would happen if mitosis occurs without cytokinesis?", "Two separate cells form", "Cell dies immediately", "One cell with multiple nuclei forms", "DNA replication stops", "C", "Explanation: Without cytokinesis, the cell becomes multinucleated."),
                ("BIO101", "Cell Division", "Which of the following is TRUE about meiosis I?", "It produces identical cells", "It separates sister chromatids", "It halves the chromosome number", "It is identical to mitosis", "C", "Explanation: Meiosis I is reduction division, halving chromosome number."),
                ("BIO101", "Cell Division", "Which checkpoint ensures DNA is correctly replicated before mitosis?", "G1 checkpoint", "S checkpoint", "G2 checkpoint", "M checkpoint", "C", "Explanation: The G2 checkpoint verifies DNA replication before mitosis begins."),
                ("BIO101", "Cell Division", "Which structure attaches to chromosomes and helps in their movement during cell division?", "Ribosome", "Spindle fibers", "Golgi apparatus", "Mitochondria", "B", "Explanation: Spindle fibers attach to chromosomes and pull them apart."),
