                #Genetics (DNA chromosomes,genes and inheritance)
                ("BIO101", "Genetics", "Which statement best explains the relationship between DNA and chromosomes?", "DNA exists independently outside chromosomes", "Chromosomes are made entirely of proteins", "Chromosomes consist of DNA tightly coiled around proteins", "DNA is only found in the cytoplasm", "C", "Explanation: Chromosomes are structures made of DNA wound around histone proteins for efficient packaging"),
