                ("BIO101", "Genetics", "What is the primary structural difference between euchromatin and heterochromatin?", "Euchromatin is tightly packed, heterochromatin is loose", "Euchromatin is transcriptionally inactive", "Heterochromatin is tightly packed and less active", "Both are equally active", "C", "Explanation: Heterochromatin is highly condensed and transcriptionally inactive, while euchromatin is less condensed and active"),
